  "description": "OAuth 2.0 authorization-code URL GET, token, introspection, and revocation over HTTPS via OfficialApiNode. RFCs 6749, 6750, 7662, 7009. Auth HTTP Basic client_id + client_secret (password). Hosts without scheme; paths concatenated after host. A path may contain `/`; each segment is encoded and the slashes stay. saml-decode-assertion and saml-validate-assertion are local crypto — not executable on OfficialApiNode (HTTP only). HTTPS only. Never log tokens or client_secret.",
